{"id":3067,"date":"2021-01-27T14:18:12","date_gmt":"2021-01-27T14:18:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/application\/industrial-applications\/"},"modified":"2021-10-06T12:40:08","modified_gmt":"2021-10-06T12:40:08","slug":"industrial-applications","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/industrial-applications\/","title":{"rendered":"Industrial applications"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"3067\" class=\"elementor elementor-3067 elementor-513\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-74b4c82 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"74b4c82\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6b7e795\" data-id=\"6b7e795\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bdb8c86 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bdb8c86\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We offer a wide range of instruments and equipment for all phases of industrial production in all areas: in the chemical, petroleum (petrochemical), automotive, electrical, paper and many other fields of industry, including nanotechnology.<\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-599 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/9cee6c38-300x162.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"418\" height=\"226\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/9cee6c38-300x162.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/9cee6c38.jpg 740w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 418px) 100vw, 418px\" \/>We also supply autosamplers and a large number of intelligent measuring accessories and dedicated software, including automated procedures for routine applications. You will thus have control over the entire production process, from the quality of the raw materials to the verification of the parameters of the final products. Examples of molecular spectroscopy applications in industry:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/science-research-education\/carbon-nano-applications\/\">Carbon nanoapplications<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/veda-vyzkum-skolstvi\/charakterizace-amorfniho-a-krystalickeho-kremiku\/\">Characterization of amorphous and crystalline silicon<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/pharmacy-and-medicine\/determination-of-ozone-concentration\/\">Determination of ozone concentration<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.thermofisher.com\/cz\/en\/home\/industrial\/spectroscopy-elemental-isotope-analysis\/spectroscopy-elemental-isotope-analysis-applications\/analytical-instrument-solutions-automotive\/automotive-fluids-lubricants\/affirma-service-lubricant-analysis-system-guide.html?icid=MSD_SPEC_MOL_PP_POD_IQLAADGAAGFAQVMBKA_6845_0918\">Oil wear analysis<\/a>(ASTM D2668, D7412, D7414, D7415, D7418, D7624, E2412; JOAP; DIN 51452, DIN 51453 etc.)<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/industrial-applications\/classification-of-polyethylene-using-raman-spectroscopy\/\">Classification of polyethylene using Raman spectroscopy<\/a><\/li>\n<li>QA\/QC oils and lubricants<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/pharmacy-and-medicine\/quality-control-of-disinfectants-during-production\/\">Quality control of disinfectants during production<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Monitoring of rapeseed oil oxidation<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikace\/prumyslove-aplikace\/vytvrzovani-akrylatu-kombinace-ft-ir-spektroskopie-a-reologie\/\">Acrylate curing: a combination of FT-IR spectroscopy and rheology<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Control of bioethanol production<\/li>\n<li>Quantification of oil substances in waters and soils<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/industrial-applications\/solvent-regeneration\/\">Solvent regeneration<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Analysis of the main parameters of gasoline and diesel<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/food-agriculture-and-feed\/analysis-and-control-of-packaging-materials-for-food-industry\/\">Control and analysis of packaging materials<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Polymer analysis: <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/industrial-applications\/polymer-analysis\/\">Polymer kit<\/a> = manuals, libraries, extensive sampling accessories, etc.<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/industrial-applications\/quantitative-analysis-of-phthalate-content\/\">Quantitative analysis of phthalate content<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Analysis of carbon materials<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/industrial-applications\/control-of-the-composition-and-purity-of-medical-gases\/\">Control of composition and purity of (not only) medical gases<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Quick check of the cleanliness of operations<\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/industrial-applications\/why-did-the-plastic-part-fail\/\">Detective story: Why did the plastic part fail?<\/a><\/li>\n<li>And many more<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-124ee62 dce_masking-none elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"124ee62\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"564\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads